          "back": "- 3...Nf6, entering the Four Knights Game. The most popular choice on all levels; masters play more or less only this, as they know the alternatives are inferior.\n- 3...Bc5?! develops the bishop and increases control over d4, so it looks logical, but it has a severe drawback. Your opponents will often choose it."
